 \fR \fP 
.SH "tailwind-merge"
.PP
Utility function to efficiently merge \fRTailwind CSS\fP classes in JS without style conflicts\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
import { twMerge } from 'tailwind\-merge'

twMerge('px\-2 py\-1 bg\-red hover:bg\-dark\-red', 'p\-3 bg\-[#B91C1C]')
// → 'hover:bg\-dark\-red p\-3 bg\-[#B91C1C]'
.fi
.PP

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Supports Tailwind v3\&.0 up to v3\&.4 (if you use Tailwind v2, use \fRtailwind-merge v0\&.9\&.0\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Works in all modern browsers and maintained Node versions
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fully typed
